d 'TSROBDIAG': module to compute Normality and parameter-stability tests for serially correlated time series
d
d   tsnormal performs normality tests for a series or for
d regression residuals that remain valid under serial correlation:
d Bai and Ng	    (2005) skewness, kurtosis and joint tests with
d HAC variances, the Lobato and Velasco (2004) test, and
d Anderson-Darling and	      Jarque-Bera tests with an AR-sieve
d bootstrap under the Gaussian null; the classical Jarque-Bera test
d is shown for	      comparison.    hansenstab performs Nyblom
d (1989) and Hansen (1992) tests of parameter stability in a linear
d regression, for each coefficient, the        coefficients jointly
d and all parameters including the error variance, with iid or HAC
d (Bartlett, quadratic-spectral)	variances, exact asymptotic
d p-values for any number of parameters, and wild or dependent wild
d bootstrap p-values. 
d
d KW: normality test
d KW: parameter stability test
d KW: serial correlation
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261110
d
d Author:  Yusuf Toyin Yusuf,  Kwara State University
d Support: email  YUSUF.YUSUF@@KWASU.EDU.NG
d
f tsrobdiag.sthlp
f tsnormal.ado
f tsnormal.sthlp
f ../h/hansenstab.ado
f ../h/hansenstab.sthlp
f tsrobdiag_example.do
f ../_/_hansenstab_display.ado
f ../_/_hansenstab_load.ado
f ../_/_hansenstab_mata.ado
f ../_/_tsnormal_display.ado
f ../_/_tsnormal_load.ado
f ../_/_tsnormal_mata.ado
